ion"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"sessionid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"sessionId?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional sessionId?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2623","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2623"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provider session id, when the adapter created one"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"status","children":[{"type":"text","value":"status"}]},{"type":"code","value":"status: \"ready\" | \"waiting\";","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2621","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2621"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Session status after the server half finishes"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"token","children":[{"type":"text","value":"token"}]},{"type":"code","value":"token: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2615","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2615"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Short-lived session token. Reactor uses this to connect. fal does not."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"usage","children":[{"type":"text","value":"usage?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional usage?: TokenUsage<ProviderUsageDetails>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2625","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2625"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Experimental"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Token usage / billing, when the adapter can report it"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"expiresat","text":"expiresAt","level":3},{"id":"id","text":"id","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"prompt","text":"prompt","level":3},{"id":"sessionid","text":"sessionId?","level":3},{"id":"status","text":"status","level":3},{"id":"token","text":"token","level":3},{"id":"usage","text":"usage?","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2606](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2606)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nResult of live generation. JSON-serializable so a server route can return\nit to a browser.\n\nReactor: connect with `token` and `model` (the connect slug).\nfal: `model` is the WMA app id. Open `wma(model)` through a server proxy\nthat attaches `FAL_KEY`. Do not send `token` as Key credentials.\n\n Live generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Properties\n\n### expiresAt\n\n```ts\nexpiresAt: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2617](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2617)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nToken expiry as milliseconds since epoch\n\n***\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2608](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2608)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nUnique identifier for this generation\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2613](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2613)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nConnect id for the browser client. Reactor: `reactor/helios`.\nfal: WMA app id `fal-ai/minimax-h3-max-director`.\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2619](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2619)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nPrompt the client should send when it starts the session\n\n***\n\n### sessionId?\n\n```ts\noptional sessionId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2623](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2623)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nProvider session id, when the adapter created one\n\n***\n\n### status\n\n```ts\nstatus: \"ready\" | \"waiting\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2621](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2621)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nSession status after the server half finishes\n\n***\n\n### token\n\n```ts\ntoken: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2615](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2615)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nShort-lived session token. Reactor uses this to connect. fal does not.\n\n***\n\n### usage?\n\n```ts\noptional usage?: TokenUsage<ProviderUsageDetails>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2625](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2625)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nToken usage / billing, when the adapter can report it\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LiveVideoGenerationResult\ntitle: LiveVideoGenerationResult\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2606](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2606)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nResult of live generation. JSON-serializable so a server route can return\nit to a browser.\n\nReactor: connect with `token` and `model` (the connect slug).\nfal: `model` is the WMA app id. Open `wma(model)` through a server proxy\nthat attaches `FAL_KEY`. Do not send `token` as Key credentials.\n\n Live generation is an experimental feature and may change.\n\n## Properties\n\n### expiresAt\n\n```ts\nexpiresAt: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2617](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2617)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nToken expiry as milliseconds since epoch\n\n***\n\n### id\n\n```ts\nid: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2608](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2608)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nUnique identifier for this generation\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2613](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2613)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nConnect id for the browser client. Reactor: `reactor/helios`.\nfal: WMA app id `fal-ai/minimax-h3-max-director`.\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2619](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2619)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nPrompt the client should send when it starts the session\n\n***\n\n### sessionId?\n\n```ts\noptional sessionId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2623](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2623)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nProvider session id, when the adapter created one\n\n***\n\n### status\n\n```ts\nstatus: \"ready\" | \"waiting\";\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2621](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2621)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nSession status after the server half finishes\n\n***\n\n### token\n\n```ts\ntoken: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2615](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2615)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nShort-lived session token. Reactor uses this to connect. fal does not.\n\n***\n\n### usage?\n\n```ts\noptional usage?: TokenUsage<ProviderUsageDetails>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2625](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2625)\n\n**`Experimental`**\n\nToken usage / billing, when the adapter can report it\n"}
